															<font style="" size="1">&nbsp;FMV of Land per latest Tax Declaration&nbsp;</font></td><td><input id="frm1606:txtFMVLand" style="text-align: right" maxlength="40" name="frm1606:txtFMVLand" size="20" value="" onkeypress="return numbersonly(this, event)" type="text" onblur="tickCheckboxWithValue(this);round(this,2);computeFMVLI()"></td>
														
                                                        <td>
